{
  "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>롯데월드타워 설계 과정 — 개념 재구성</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f3efe6;--ink:#1d2430;--mut:#555e6b;--line:#2a4d6e;--acc:#b5482a;--card:#fffdf8}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5}\nheader{padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 20px;align-items:baseline}\nh1{font-size:1.25rem;margin:0}\n.model{font-size:.85rem;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px}\n.note{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--mut);margin:0}\nmain{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:14px}\n@media(max-width:900px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid #c9c1b0;border-radius:8px;padding:10px}\nh2{font-size:1rem;margin:0 0 6px}\n.draw{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.draw{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\nfigure{margin:0;border:1px solid #d8d0bf;border-radius:6px;padding:6px;background:#fff}\nfigcaption{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--mut)}\nfigcaption b{color:var(--ink)}\nsvg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n#view{position:relative;height:min(68vh,620px);min-height:360px;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(#dfe7ee,#f3efe6)}\n#view canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none}\n#err{position:absolute;inset:0;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;text-align:center}\n.stages{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:8px 0}\nbutton{font:inherit;font-size:.9rem;padding:7px 11px;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;min-height:40px}\nbutton[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}\nbutton:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--acc);outline-offset:2px}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0}\ninput[type=range]{flex:1;min-width:160px;height:32px}\n#desc{font-size:.92rem;min-height:4.5em}\n.kbd{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--mut)}\nfooter{padding:10px 18px 24px;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--mut)}\na{color:var(--line)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n<h1>롯데월드타워 · 도자기의 선에서 555m까지</h1>\n<span class=\"model\">claude-opus-5.5 (us.anthropic.claude-opus-5-5)</span>\n<p class=\"note\">공개 자료(높이 555m, 지상 123층, 위로 좁아지는 형태, 한국 도자기 선 참조) 기반의 <b>설명용 개념 재구성</b>입니다. 공식 시공 도면·검증된 구조 설계가 아니며, 표시 “≈추정” 치수는 개념값입니다.</p>\n</header>\n<main>\n<section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"dh\">\n<h2 id=\"dh\">설계도면 (선택 층·단계와 연동)</h2>\n<div class=\"draw\">\n<figure><svg id=\"site\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"배치도\"></svg><figcaption><b>배치도</b> — 타워 위치와 저층 포디움, 석촌호수의 관계(개략). 단위 m, 축척막대 기준. 포디움·호수 형상은 추정.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><svg id=\"plan\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"기준층 평면도\"></svg><figcaption><b>기준층 평면도</b> — 선택 층의 외곽과 코어. 외곽 폭은 위로 갈수록 줄어드는 추정 곡선에서 계산.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><svg id=\"elev\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"입면도\"></svg><figcaption><b>입면도</b> — 전체 높이 555m(공개값), 지붕·랜턴 경계 ≈497m(추정). 붉은 선 = 선택 층.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><svg id=\"sect\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"단면도\"></svg><figcaption><b>단면도</b> — 코어·아웃리거 개념 배치. 부재 위치·크기는 개념 추정이며 구조 설계 정보가 아님.</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><label for=\"floor\">선택 층: <b id=\"fl\">60</b>F / 123F</label><input id=\"floor\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"123\" value=\"60\"></div>\n<p class=\"note\" id=\"fdim\"></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"vh\">\n<h2 id=\"vh\">단계별 3D 형상 · 완성 모델</h2>\n<div class=\"stages\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"설계 단계\"></div>\n<p id=\"desc\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n<div id=\"view\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"3D 모델: 드래그로 회전, 휠/핀치로 확대\"><div id=\"err\">3D 런타임을 불러오지 못했습니다. 도면은 계속 사용할 수 있습니다.</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><button id=\"reset\">시점 초기화 (R)</button><button id=\"zin\">확대 +</button><button id=\"zout\">축소 −</button><button id=\"rot\" aria-pressed=\"false\">자동 회전</button></div>\n<p class=\"kbd\">키보드: 1–5 단계 선택 · ↑/↓ 층 이동 · ←/→ 모델 회전 · +/− 확대 · R 초기화</p>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer>출처(텍스트 참조, 실행 중 불러오지 않음): 원 설계 KPF <a href=\"https://www.kpf.com/project/lotte-world-tower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">kpf.com/project/lotte-world-tower</a> · 구조 설계 LERA <a href=\"https://www.lera.com/lotte-world-tower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lera.com/lotte-world-tower</a></footer>\n<script src=\"../runtime/three-runtime.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\nconst H=555, ROOF=497, FLOORS=123;\nconst STAGES=[\n {n:\"1 매스 설정\",d:\"대지와 용적을 정하는 첫 단계: 단순한 정사각 기둥(개념). 기준층 폭은 일정하다고 가정합니다.\"},\n {n:\"2 테이퍼\",d:\"위로 갈수록 기준층 면적과 외곽이 좁아지는 형태로 변환. 직선 테이퍼(추정).\"},\n {n:\"3 도자기의 선\",d:\"KPF가 언급한 한국 도자기의 선을 참조해 곡선형 외곽과 면 중앙의 이음선(seam)을 표현. 곡률은 추정.\"},\n {n:\"4 구조 개념\",d:\"중앙 코어와 층별 아웃리거·벨트 개념을 투시. 위치·부재는 설명용 추정이며 LERA의 실제 설계가 아닙니다.\"},\n {n:\"5 완성 모델\",d:\"랜턴형 상부를 포함한 완성 형상, 높이 555m·123층. 실제 형상을 단순화한 재구성입니다.\"}];\nlet stage=4, floor=60;\nfunction zOf(f){return f/FLOORS*ROOF}\nfunction half(z,s){const t=Math.min(z/H,1);\n if(s===0)return 34; if(s===1)return 36-24*t;\n return 36*(1-0.66*Math.pow(t,1.35))+ (t>0.9?-4*(t-0.9)/0.1:0);}\nfunction expn(z,s){return s===0?12:s===1?8:8-4.5*Math.min(z/H,1)}\nfunction ring(z,s,N){const a=half(z,s),n=expn(z,s),p=[];\n for(let i=0;i<N;i++){const th=i/N*Math.PI*2,c=Math.cos(th),sn=Math.sin(th);\n  let x=Math.sign(c)*Math.pow(Math.abs(c),2/n)*a,y=Math.sign(sn)*Math.pow(Math.abs(sn),2/n)*a;\n  if(s>=2){const t=z/H,g=Math.pow(Math.cos(2*th),40)*Math.max(0,t-0.25)*0.09;x*=1-g;y*=1-g;}\n  p.push([x,y]);}return p;}\n// stage buttons\nconst sg=document.querySelector('.stages');\nSTAGES.forEach((s,i)=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=s.n;b.onclick=()=>setStage(i);sg.appendChild(b)});\nconst NS=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\";\nfunction el(t,a,p){const e=document.createElementNS(NS,t);for(const k in a)e.setAttribute(k,a[k]);p&&p.appendChild(e);return e}\nfunction txt(p,x,y,s,o){const e=el('text',Object.assign({x,y,'font-size':9,fill:'#1d2430'},o||{}),p);e.textContent=s;return e}\nfunction clear(id){const s=document.getElementById(id);s.innerHTML='';return s}\nfunction scaleBar(s,x,y,px,label){el('path',{d:`M${x} ${y}h${px}M${x} ${y-3}v6M${x+px} ${y-3}v6`,stroke:'#1d2430',fill:'none'},s);txt(s,x,y-5,label)}\nfunction drawSite(){const s=clear('site');\n el('path',{d:\"M10 150 C60 120 120 175 170 160 S260 190 290 170 L290 235 L10 235Z\",fill:\"#cfe0ea\",stroke:\"#2a4d6e\"},s);\n txt(s,120,215,\"석촌호수(개략)\",{fill:'#2a4d6e'});\n el('rect',{x:60,y:40,width:170,height:90,fill:\"#ece5d6\",stroke:\"#555e6b\",\"stroke-dasharray\":\"4 2\"},s);\n txt(s,64,52,\"포디움/몰(추정 윤곽)\",{fill:'#555e6b'});\n const k=1.1,cx=190,cy=88,p=ring(1,stage,64).map(q=>(cx+q[0]*k)+\",\"+(cy+q[1]*k)).join(\" \");\n el('polygon',{points:p,fill:\"#fff\",stroke:\"#b5482a\",\"stroke-width\":1.6},s);txt(s,cx-14,cy+3,\"타워\");\n el('path',{d:\"M270 20 l6 16 -6 -4 -6 4z\",fill:\"#1d2430\"},s);txt(s,266,48,\"N\");\n scaleBar(s,12,22,k*50,\"50 m\");txt(s,12,232,\"단위 m · 타워 외곽은 모델 1F 링과 동일\");}\nfunction drawPlan(){const s=clear('plan'),z=zOf(floor),k=2.6,cx=150,cy=122;\n for(let i=-40;i<=40;i+=10){el('line',{x1:cx+i*k,y1:20,x2:cx+i*k,y2:225,stroke:\"#e3dccd\"},s);el('line',{x1:40,y1:cy+i*k,x2:260,y2:cy+i*k,stroke:\"#e3dccd\"},s)}\n const p=ring(z,stage,96).map(q=>(cx+q[0]*k)+\",\"+(cy+q[1]*k)).join(\" \");\n el('polygon',{points:p,fill:\"#fdf3ea\",stroke:\"#b5482a\",\"stroke-width\":1.8},s);\n const c=Math.min(14,half(z,stage)*0.45);el('rect',{x:cx-c*k,y:cy-c*k,width:2*c*k,height:2*c*k,fill:\"#d9d2c3\",stroke:\"#555e6b\"},s);\n txt(s,cx-10,cy+3,\"코어\");const a=half(z,stage);\n el('path',{d:`M${cx-a*k} 228h${2*a*k}`,stroke:\"#2a4d6e\"},s);txt(s,cx-22,224,`≈${(2*a).toFixed(1)} m`,{fill:'#2a4d6e'});\n txt(s,8,14,`${floor}F · 높이≈${z.toFixed(0)} m · 격자 10 m`);}\nfunction profile(s,k,x0,y0,full){let L=\"\",R=\"\";for(let z=0;z<=(full?H:ROOF);z+=5){const a=half(z,stage);L+=(z?\"L\":\"M\")+(x0-a*k)+\" \"+(y0-z*k);R=`L${x0+a*k} ${y0-z*k}`+R}\n el('path',{d:L+R.replace(/^L/,\"L\")+\"Z\",fill:\"#fdf3ea\",stroke:\"#1d2430\"},s)}\nfunction drawElev(){const s=clear('elev'),k=0.38,x0=150,y0=225;profile(s,k,x0,y0,stage===4);\n if(stage>=2)el('line',{x1:x0,y1:y0-0.25*H*k,x2:x0,y2:y0-ROOF*k,stroke:\"#2a4d6e\",\"stroke-dasharray\":\"3 2\"},s);\n const y=y0-zOf(floor)*k;el('line',{x1:60,y1:y,x2:240,y2:y,stroke:\"#b5482a\",\"stroke-width\":1.5},s);txt(s,242,y+3,floor+\"F\",{fill:'#b5482a'});\n el('path',{d:`M40 ${y0}V${y0-H*k}`,stroke:\"#2a4d6e\"},s);txt(s,8,y0-H*k+4,\"555 m\");txt(s,8,y0-ROOF*k+4,\"≈497\");txt(s,20,y0,\"0\");\n el('line',{x1:20,y1:y0,x2:280,y2:y0,stroke:\"#1d2430\"},s);if(stage>=2)txt(s,155,y0-140*k,\"이음선\",{fill:'#2a4d6e'});}\nfunction drawSect(){const s=clear('sect'),k=0.38,x0=150,y0=225;profile(s,k,x0,y0,stage===4);\n for(let f=10;f<=120;f+=10){const z=zOf(f),a=half(z,stage);el('line',{x1:x0-a*k,y1:y0-z*k,x2:x0+a*k,y2:y0-z*k,stroke:\"#c9c1b0\"},s)}\n el('rect',{x:x0-6,y:y0-ROOF*k,width:12,height:ROOF*k,fill:\"#bdb4a2\"},s);\n if(stage>=3)[0.2,0.45,0.7,0.88].forEach(t=>{const z=ROOF*t,a=half(z,stage);el('rect',{x:x0-a*k,y:y0-z*k-3,width:2*a*k,height:5,fill:\"#2a4d6e\",opacity:.75},s)});\n const y=y0-zOf(floor)*k;el('line',{x1:60,y1:y,x2:240,y2:y,stroke:\"#b5482a\",\"stroke-width\":1.5},s);\n txt(s,8,14,\"회색=코어(개념) · 청색=아웃리거/벨트(추정)\");txt(s,8,26,\"층선 10층 간격, 층고 ≈4.0 m(추정 평균)\");\n el('line',{x1:20,y1:y0,x2:280,y2:y0,stroke:\"#1d2430\"},s);}\nfunction drawAll(){drawSite();drawPlan();drawElev();drawSect();\n const z=zOf(floor),a=half(z,stage);document.getElementById('fl').textContent=floor;\n document.getElementById('fdim').textContent=`${floor}F 외곽 폭 ≈${(2*a).toFixed(1)} m, 바닥면적 ≈${Math.round(polyArea(ring(z,stage,96)))} m² (모두 개념 추정). 3D 모델의 붉은 링이 같은 층입니다.`;}\nfunction polyArea(p){let A=0;for(let i=0;i<p.length;i++){const a=p[i],b=p[(i+1)%p.length];A+=a[0]*b[1]-b[0]*a[1]}return Math.abs(A/2)}\n// 3D\nlet scene,camera,renderer,controls,group,floorRing,T=window.THREE;\nconst reduce=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\nconst view=document.getElementById('view');\nfunction init3D(){if(!T||!T.OrbitControls){document.getElementById('err').style.display='flex';return}\n scene=new T.Scene();camera=new T.PerspectiveCamera(40,1,1,5000);\n renderer=new T.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,alpha:true});renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));view.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n controls=new T.OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);controls.enableDamping=!reduce;controls.minDistance=150;controls.maxDistance=2200;controls.target.set(0,260,0);\n scene.add(new T.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x887766,1.4));const dl=new T.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.6);dl.position.set(400,700,300);scene.add(dl);\n const g=new T.Mesh(new T.CircleGeometry(300,48),new T.MeshLambertMaterial({color:0xd9d2c3}));g.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;scene.add(g);\n const pod=new T.Mesh(new T.BoxGeometry(170,30,90),new T.MeshLambertMaterial({color:0xece5d6}));pod.position.set(-30,15,-40);scene.add(pod);\n resetView();resize();new ResizeObserver(resize).observe(view);build();loop();}\nfunction resetView(){if(!camera)return;camera.position.set(700,420,800);controls.target.set(0,260,0);controls.update()}\nfunction resize(){if(!renderer)return;const w=view.clientWidth,h=view.clientHeight;renderer.setSize(w,h,false);camera.aspect=w/h;camera.updateProjectionMatrix()}\nfunction towerGeo(s,top){const N=96,step=6,rows=[];for(let z=0;z<=top;z+=step)rows.push(z);if(rows[rows.length-1]<top)rows.push(top);\n const pos=[],idx=[];rows.forEach(z=>ring(z,s,N).forEach(q=>pos.push(q[0],z,q[1])));\n for(let r=0;r<rows.length-1;r++)for(let i=0;i<N;i++){const a=r*N+i,b=r*N+(i+1)%N,c=a+N,d=b+N;idx.push(a,c,b,b,c,d)}\n const geo=new T.BufferGeometry();geo.setAttribute('position',new T.Float32BufferAttribute(pos,3));geo.setIndex(idx);geo.computeVertexNormals();return geo}\nfunction build(){if(!scene)return;if(group)scene.remove(group);group=new T.Group();scene.add(group);\n const top=stage===4?ROOF:H;const glass=new T.MeshPhongMaterial({color:stage>=2?0xb9cfdc:0xcfc6b3,shininess:80,transparent:stage===3,opacity:stage===3?0.25:1,side:T.DoubleSide});\n group.add(new T.Mesh(towerGeo(stage,top),glass));\n if(stage>=2){const m=new T.LineBasicMaterial({color:0x2a4d6e});[0,1,2,3].forEach(q=>{const th=q*Math.PI/2,pts=[];for(let z=0.25*H;z<=top;z+=6){const a=half(z,stage)*0.995*(1-0.09*Math.max(0,z/H-0.25));pts.push(new T.Vector3(Math.cos(th)*a,z,Math.sin(th)*a))}group.add(new T.Line(new T.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(pts),m))})}\n if(stage>=3){const core=new T.Mesh(new T.BoxGeometry(26,ROOF,26),new T.MeshLambertMaterial({color:0x8a8070,transparent:stage===4,opacity:stage===4?0.0:1}));core.position.y=ROOF/2;if(stage===3)group.add(core);\n  if(stage===3)[0.2,0.45,0.7,0.88].forEach(t=>{const z=ROOF*t,a=half(z,3)*1.8;const o=new T.Mesh(new T.BoxGeometry(a,8,a),new T.MeshLambertMaterial({color:0x2a4d6e,transparent:true,opacity:.7}));o.position.y=z;group.add(o)})}\n if(stage===4){const pts=[];const lm=new T.LineBasicMaterial({color:0x2a4d6e});for(let i=0;i<4;i++){const th=i*Math.PI/2+Math.PI/4,pp=[];for(let z=ROOF;z<=H;z+=4){const a=half(z,4)*0.9;pp.push(new T.Vector3(Math.cos(th)*a,z,Math.sin(th)*a))}group.add(new T.Line(new T.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(pp),lm))}\n  for(let z=ROOF;z<H;z+=12){const r=ring(z,4,48).map(q=>new T.Vector3(q[0]*.9,z,q[1]*.9));r.push(r[0]);group.add(new T.Line(new T.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(r),lm))}}\n floorRing=null;updateFloor();}\nfunction updateFloor(){if(!group)return;if(floorRing)group.remove(floorRing);const z=zOf(floor),r=ring(z,stage,96).map(q=>new T.Vector3(q[0]*1.03,z,q[1]*1.03));r.push(r[0]);\n floorRing=new T.Line(new T.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(r),new T.LineBasicMaterial({color:0xb5482a}));\n const slab=new T.Mesh(new T.ShapeGeometry(new T.Shape(ring(z,stage,96).map(q=>new T.Vector2(q[0]*1.04,-q[1]*1.04)))),new T.MeshBasicMaterial({color:0xb5482a,transparent:true,opacity:.45,side:T.DoubleSide}));slab.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;slab.position.y=z;\n const g=new T.Group();g.add(floorRing,slab);floorRing=g;group.add(g)}\nlet auto=false;\nfunction loop(){requestAnimationFrame(loop);if(auto&&group)group.rotation.y+=0.004;controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera)}\nfunction zoom(f){if(!camera)return;const v=camera.position.clone().sub(controls.target).multiplyScalar(f);if(v.length()>150&&v.length()<2200)camera.position.copy(controls.target).add(v);controls.update()}\nfunction setStage(i){stage=i;[...sg.children].forEach((b,j)=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',j===i));document.getElementById('desc').textContent=STAGES[i].d;drawAll();build()}\nconst fs=document.getElementById('floor');fs.oninput=()=>{floor=+fs.value;drawAll();updateFloor()};\ndocument.getElementById('reset').onclick=resetView;document.getElementById('zin').onclick=()=>zoom(0.8);document.getElementById('zout').onclick=()=>zoom(1.25);\nconst rb=document.getElementById('rot');rb.onclick=()=>{auto=!auto;rb.setAttribute('aria-pressed',auto)};\ndocument.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.target.tagName==='INPUT'&&e.key.startsWith('Arrow'))return;\n if(e.key>='1'&&e.key<='5')setStage(+e.key-1);\n else if(e.key==='ArrowUp'||e.key==='ArrowDown'){e.preventDefault();floor=Math.max(1,Math.min(123,floor+(e.key==='ArrowUp'?1:-1)));fs.value=floor;drawAll();updateFloor()}\n else if((e.key==='ArrowLeft'||e.key==='ArrowRight')&&group){e.preventDefault();group.rotation.y+=e.key==='ArrowLeft'?-0.15:0.15}\n else if(e.key==='+'||e.key==='=')zoom(0.8);else if(e.key==='-')zoom(1.25);else if(e.key==='r'||e.key==='R')resetView();});\ntry{init3D()}catch(err){document.getElementById('err').style.display='flex'}\nsetStage(4);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n